sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Agent 运行时
  participant M as LLM
  participant C as MCP Client
  participant S as MCP Server
  App->>C: 启动时 list_tools
  C->>S: tools/list (JSON-RPC)
  S-->>C: 工具名 + JSON Schema
  App->>M: messages + tools schema
  M-->>App: tool_call {name, arguments}
  App->>App: 校验参数(Schema) + 权限
  App->>C: call_tool
  C->>S: tools/call
  S-->>C: result content
  App->>M: role=tool 回填结果
  M-->>App: 最终回答 或 下一个 tool_call
